<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 4.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 4.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 4.8 percent on Saturday from 5.1 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded on the market in 10 reported transactions with a total value of 12.5 million dinars ($17.7 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
